# Motion consistency

Use shared helpers from `@/lib/motion/classes` instead of one-off Tailwind motion classes in feature code (`src/components/`, `src/app/`).

## Do

- Import the right helper: `motionPressable`, `motionTransitionInteractive`, `motionTransitionColors`, `motionListRow`, `motionChip`, `motionChevronOpen`, `motionCollapseGrid`, `motionSurfaceCard`, `motionSurfaceElevated`, `motionInputFocus`, `motionProgressIndicator`, `motionLinkHover`
- Compose with `cn()` alongside layout/state classes
- Run `npm run motion:check` (`node scripts/check-house-motion.mjs`) before shipping UI changes

## Entrances

Use `motionEnter*` helpers — **not** `animate-in` / tw-animate-css entrance utilities.

| Pattern | Helper |
|---------|--------|
| Default blur + rise | `cn(motionEnter, motionEnterDurNormal)` |
| Opacity-only (status text) | `motionEnterFade` |
| From top / right / left / bottom | `motionEnterFromTop`, `motionEnterFromRight`, `motionEnterFromLeft`, `motionEnterFromBottom` |
| Zoom pop (checkmarks) | `cn(motionEnterZoom, motionEnterDurNormal)` |
| Small zoom (icons) | `cn(motionEnterZoomSm, motionEnterDurSlow)` |

Compose duration modifiers: `motionEnterDurFast`, `motionEnterDurNormal`, `motionEnterDurSlow`, `motionEnterDurList` (240ms).

List row stagger: `style={motionListEnterStagger(index)}` — only on first paint / newly added rows.

Expand/collapse: `motionCollapseGrid` (`t-collapse-grid`) with `data-open="true" | "false"`.

## Press

MyEPBuddy press scale is **0.98** (`t-press`). Do not hand-write `active:scale-[0.98]` or copy PeriDocs' `0.99`.

## Keep (MyEPBuddy-specific — do not replace with PeriDocs equivalents)

- `t-collapse-grid` (`data-open` driven), `t-resize`, `epb-t-resize`
- `animate-elevator-*` split-view transitions and `animate-pulse-highlight`
- Any bespoke motion inside `src/components/epb/mpa-section-card.tsx`

## Don't

- `animate-in fade-in slide-in-*` — use `motionEnter*` helpers above
- `active:scale-95` / `active:scale-100` / hand-written `active:scale-[0.98]` — use `motionPressable`
- `transition-all duration-150|200|300` on interactive surfaces — use `motionTransitionInteractive` or a domain helper
- `duration-300 ease-in-out` — use `--duration-*` + `--ease-*` tokens
- Invent new easing curves or durations outside `src/app/globals.css` tokens
- Port PeriDocs marketing / WebGL / Figma-inspector motion into this repo

## Sacred surfaces (STOP)

Never restyle, re-time, or refactor the EPB **MPA split view** or **sentence drag-and-drop** in `src/components/epb/mpa-section-card.tsx` (including `SentenceDropOverlay` and DnD sensors) as part of a motion migration. Skip the file.

Radix primitives in `src/components/ui/` keep their built-in `data-[state]` animations — migrate them deliberately, not as a side effect of a feature change.
